{
  "source": "course-assets/how-ai-learns/how-ai-learns.mp4",
  "duration": 203.8186875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.82,
      "text": "Modern AI can explain complex chemistry,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.2,
      "end": 6.02,
      "text": "write functional code, and help you improve an essay."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.74,
      "end": 8.2,
      "text": "How did it learn to do those things?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.2,
      "end": 10.66,
      "text": "Think about learning to shoot a basketball."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.28,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "You try a shot, see how you did,"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.18,
      "end": 14.94,
      "text": "and make an adjustment to your mechanics."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.9,
      "end": 18.22,
      "text": "AI also learns through repeated attempts."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.94,
      "end": 20.7,
      "text": "Let's follow the process from preparation"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.7,
      "end": 22.9,
      "text": "to a model that is ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.82,
      "end": 25.52,
      "text": "Two things happen before training starts."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.94,
      "end": 27.3,
      "text": "First, set up the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.3,
      "end": 31.42,
      "text": "Engineers design the model and give its internal numbers starting values."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.1,
      "end": 34.22,
      "text": "Training will adjust those numbers as the model learns."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.08,
      "end": 36.46,
      "text": "Second, gather the data."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.12,
      "end": 42.52,
      "text": "Teams collect books, websites, conversations, code, images, audio, and video."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 44.28,
      "text": "This becomes the curriculum."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.7,
      "end": 48.24,
      "text": "Training builds different abilities in three main phases."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.94,
      "end": 51.22,
      "text": "Phase one is pre-training, learn patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.66,
      "end": 54.74,
      "text": "Phase two is instruction tuning, learn to follow instructions."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.74,
      "end": 58.66,
      "text": "Phase 3 is preference tuning. Improve responses through feedback."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.7,
      "end": 62.8,
      "text": "Across all three phases, training follows a basic loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.42,
      "end": 66.88,
      "text": "Guess, check, and adjust. What changes is the"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.88,
      "end": 70.84,
      "text": "examples and feedback used to guide those adjustments. Here is a simple"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.84,
      "end": 74.54,
      "text": "example. Given the phrase peanut butter and blank,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.98,
      "end": 78.26,
      "text": "the model makes a guess. In this instance, it guesses cloud."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.22,
      "end": 82.68,
      "text": "Next is the check. The actual training example says jelly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.68,
      "end": 85.48,
      "text": "so the system compares its guess with that correct word."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.28,
      "end": 87.58,
      "text": "Finally, the adjust phase."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.22,
      "end": 89.88,
      "text": "The system tweaks its internal numbers"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.88,
      "end": 92.96,
      "text": "to make jelly more likely in this specific situation."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.54,
      "end": 95.7,
      "text": "Then the loop runs again on the next example."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.44,
      "end": 99.1,
      "text": "Those adjustments change the model's internal numbers"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.1,
      "end": 99.98,
      "text": "called weights."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.88,
      "end": 102.84,
      "text": "Now let's look at the first phase of training"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.84,
      "end": 103.76,
      "text": "called pre-training."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.64,
      "end": 107.04,
      "text": "In pre-training, the model learns from more text"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.04,
      "end": 109.18,
      "text": "than you could read in 1,000 lifetimes."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.78,
      "end": 111.98,
      "text": "Across vast amounts of text and code,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.98,
      "end": 114.94,
      "text": "it learns broad patterns in language and information."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.74,
      "end": 117.36,
      "text": "The model can produce fluent text,"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.38,
      "end": 120.04,
      "text": "but it doesn't reliably follow your instructions yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.74,
      "end": 122.86,
      "text": "Training keeps adjusting the model's weights."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.7,
      "end": 125.08,
      "text": "What changes in the next phases"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.08,
      "end": 127.02,
      "text": "is the kind of examples and feedback"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.02,
      "end": 128.68,
      "text": "used to guide those adjustments."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.4,
      "end": 131.64,
      "text": "This brings us to phase two, instruction tuning."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.44,
      "end": 133.94,
      "text": "Now people provide questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.94,
      "end": 135.8,
      "text": "paired with helpful example answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.48,
      "end": 138.52,
      "text": "The model practices answering those questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.66,
      "end": 139.68,
      "text": "adjusting its weights,"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.68,
      "end": 142.36,
      "text": "so its answers become more like those human examples."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.38,
      "end": 144.8,
      "text": "The model can follow a request,"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.18,
      "end": 147.06,
      "text": "but its answer may still be unclear,"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.36,
      "end": 148.64,
      "text": "incomplete, or unhelpful."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.38,
      "end": 150.76,
      "text": "Following instructions is a start."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.58,
      "end": 153.38,
      "text": "Next, the model learns from feedback"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.38,
      "end": 155.6,
      "text": "about which answers people find more helpful."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.2,
      "end": 157.08,
      "text": "That's preference tuning."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.92,
      "end": 158.5,
      "text": "In phase three,"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.92,
      "end": 161.08,
      "text": "the model produces several answers to a question."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.6,
      "end": 164.06,
      "text": "People compare those answers and select the best one"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.06,
      "end": 166.7,
      "text": "based on clear, useful, and accurate information."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.46,
      "end": 169.06,
      "text": "Training adjusts the model's weights"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.06,
      "end": 171.52,
      "text": "to make answers like the selected one more likely."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.34,
      "end": 173.94,
      "text": "However, there is still work to do."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.34,
      "end": 175.76,
      "text": "Feedback helps improve the answers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.88,
      "end": 178.58,
      "text": "but AI can still give a wrong answer that sounds right."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.48,
      "end": 181.72,
      "text": "When training ends, the model is ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.2,
      "end": 184.86,
      "text": "It relies entirely on the final internal weights"
    },
    {
      "start": 184.86,
      "end": 186.98,
      "text": "produced by that long three-phase process."
    },
    {
      "start": 187.7,
      "end": 188.6,
      "text": "During a normal chat,"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.86,
      "end": 190.8,
      "text": "it can work with new information you give it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.82,
      "end": 193.12,
      "text": "but your conversation does not change those weights."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.9,
      "end": 195.84,
      "text": "AI learns from examples and feedback."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.48,
      "end": 197.98,
      "text": "Guess, check, adjust."
    },
    {
      "start": 197.98,
      "end": 198.98,
      "text": "repeat"
    }
  ],
